ury-inspired design.</p>\n<p data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"785\">At its core, the OX Dubai features a high-performance motor and advanced suspension system, delivering a smooth and stable ride across city streets, rough terrain, and long-distance commutes. Whether you're navigating daily traffic or cruising for leisure, every ride feels controlled, responsive, and effortless.</p>\n<p data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"1089\">Designed with both aesthetics and durability in mind, the OX Dubai stands out with its distinctive Dubai edition styling \u2014 a refined look that reflects innovation and exclusivity. Its robust frame ensures long-term reliability, while the intuitive folding mechanism makes it practical for everyday use.</p>", "published_at": "2026-04-26T02:48:00-04:00", "created_at": "2026-04-26T02:39:49-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-17T10:29:21-05:00", "vendor": "INOKIM NYC", "product_type": "scooter", "tags": [], "variants": [{"id": 53012209402172, "title": "Super - Top Range 60 Miles / Orange", "option1": "Super - Top Range 60 Miles", "option2": "Orange", "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": {"id": 55022843822396, "product_id": 10373167841596, "position": 2, "created_at": "2026-04-26T02:46:10-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-04-26T02:46:11-04:00", "alt": null, "width": 612, "height": 408, "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0870/8993/8748/files/401A0739_copy-removebg-preview.png?v=1777185971", "variant_ids": [53012209402172, 53012211138876]}, "available": true, "price": "2850.00", "grams": 0, "compare_at_price": "0.00", "position": 1, "product_id": 10373167841596, "created_at": "2026-04-26T02:39:49-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-17T10:29:21-05:00"}, {"id": 53012211138876, "title": "Super - Top Range 60 Miles / Yellow", "option1": "Super - Top Range 60 Miles", "option2": "Yellow", "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": {"id": 55022843822396, "product_id"