 of OX is SGS-certified for UL 2272, assuring not only an exhilarating ride but also safe storage for your Inokim.\u00a0</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Designed by top tech artists in TLV, the OX is more than a scooter.\u00a0it's a fusion of cutting-edge performance and sophisticated design, perfectly suited for those seeking both thrill and refinement.</span></p>", "published_at": "2025-07-24T00:30:50-04:00", "created_at": "2025-03-16T14:37:45-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-17T10:29:21-05:00", "vendor": "INOKIM NYC", "product_type": "scooter", "tags": [], "variants": [{"id": 51499845058876, "title": "Super - Top Range 60 Miles / Green", "option1": "Super - Top Range 60 Miles", "option2": "Green", "option3": null, "sku": "", "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": {"id": 50857405743420, "product_id": 9954824749372, "position": 1, "created_at": "2025-03-16T14:32:52-04:00", "updated_at": "2025-03-16T14:32:53-04:00", "alt": null, "width": 819, "height": 1080, "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0870/8993/8748/files/OX_1_2.png?v=1742149973", "variant_ids": [51499845058876, 51499845091644, 51499845124412]}, "available": false, "price": "2750.00", "grams": 0, "compare_at_price": "0.00", "position": 1, "product_id": 9954824749372, "created_at": "2025-03-16T14:37:46-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-17T10:29:21-05:00"}, {"id": 51499845091644, "title": "Super - Top Range 60 Miles / Orange", "option1": "Super - Top Range 60 Miles", "option2": "Orange", "option3": null, "sku": "", "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": {"id": 50857405743420, "product_id": 9954824749372, "position": 1, "created_at": "2025-03-16T14:32:52-04:00", "updated_at": "2025-03-16T14:32:53-04:00", "alt": null, "width": 819, "height": 1080, "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0870/8993/8748/files/OX_1_2.png?v=1742149973", "variant_ids": [51499845058876, 51499845091644, 51499845124412]}, "available": false, "price": "2750.00", "grams": 