s. Unleash the power of its 1000W Dual Brushless Hub Motors (1300W peak), reaching speeds up to 40.3 mph. With an impressive 68-mile range per charge and rugged pneumatic tires, and water-resistant IPX4 rating, this scooter is your ticket to urban exploration and off-road adventures.\u00a0</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Thanks to the adjustable dual suspensions, designed by top tech artists in TLV, the OXO ensures a smooth ride in every terrain.\u00a0</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Rest easy knowing this model of <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>OXO is SGS-certified for UL 2272</strong></span>, combining style, performance, and safety.</span></p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>", "published_at": "2025-07-24T00:30:30-04:00", "created_at": "2025-03-16T12:05:19-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-17T10:29:21-05:00", "vendor": "INOKIM NYC", "product_type": "scooter", "tags": ["vehicle"], "variants": [{"id": 51499572461884, "title": "Special Edition / Red", "option1": "Special Edition", "option2": "Red", "option3": null, "sku": "", "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": {"id": 48731067941180, "product_id": 9954796011836, "position": 2, "created_at": "2024-10-08T10:08:04-04:00", "updated_at": "2024-10-08T10:08:05-04:00", "alt": null, "width": 819, "height": 1080, "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0870/8993/8748/files/carbon_red_03_1_819x_f0c43991-5dbe-4832-8f14-98e39d4223fd.webp?v=1728396485", "variant_ids": [51499572461884]}, "available": false, "price": "3500.00", "grams": 0, "compare_at_price": "0.00", "position": 1, "product_id": 9954796011836, "created_at": "2025-03-16T12:09:51-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-17T10:29:21-05:00"}, {"id": 51499572494652, "title": "Special Edition / Black", "option1": "Special Edition", "option2": "Black", "option3": null, "sku": "", "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": {"id": 50856927822140, "product_id": 9954796011836, "position": 1,